        <mxCell id="Hhp667tVKxhIkd8h5iBH-16" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;log_display.gd&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Contains functions which do the following:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Grab logs from logger and display them&lt;br&gt;in an HBoxContainer.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Show the most recent 5 logs and make&lt;br&gt;them fade after a set amount of time.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Color-code the messages based on&lt;br&gt;category.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
