        <mxCell id="Hhp667tVKxhIkd8h5iBH-19" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Timer Node&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Connects to all scripts&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Responsible for refreshing the data every second&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="290" x="1148.5" y="1230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="zFv2tLNQEjs7czilCVUB-4" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; Data Generator Server (data_generator_server/src/main.rs)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Rust Actix-Web server which acts as an end point which can be accesible over the web.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Runs data_generator.py everytime /generator is accessed.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Returns 401 if .env file is missing on the instance.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;This server also contains endpoints for per-user configuration of settings including&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Waddles configuration (color, accessories, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Privacy settings configuration&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;These are controlled via a browser-based, CLI-based, or application-based program&lt;br&gt;leveraging Kerberos or OIDC for seamless usage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;This server writes to a special labmap Organizational Unit in the OCF LDAP.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Saving of custom art is TBA.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="260" width="508" x="1502" y="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
